  id: media
  nombre: Mid inclined
  descripcionBreve: Inclined orbit at intermediate altitude that keeps passing over the anomaly.
  costoCr: 90
  ventaja: Repeated tracking of the anomaly
  limitacion: Less surface detail in the game's simplified model
  datoNasa: "Like ESA's Trace Gas Orbiter: about 400 km, 74\xB0. Its plane drifts, so it sees each region at different times of day."
  datoNasaEs: "Como el Trace Gas Orbiter de la ESA: unos 400 km, 74\xB0. Su plano se desplaza y ve cada regi\xF3n a distintas horas."
  fuenteNasa: ESA
